[signal arg="clown_enter"]
[wait time="1.5"]
Ben: W-who are you and w-what are you doing here...
Clown: Hiiiiii..... Little boy.... Do you wanna play?
Ben: Wha..What?
- Run away
	[signal arg="action_run"]
	Ben: I-I'm not alone!
	Clown: Hehehe....
	[signal arg="clown_follows"]
- Stay and play
	[signal arg="action_stay"]
